# Build context of the production images (apps/api/Dockerfile, deploy/caddy/Dockerfile): the repo
# root. Only sources and manifests go in; everything is installed and built inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets: no environment file ever enters an image (the examples are harmless).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example

.git
.github
.claude
docs
apps/*/.screenshots
# Design handoff (screenshots, mockups): never imported by the code.
apps/web/design
# Future React Native app (docs/plans/mobile-foundations.md): not part of these images.
apps/mobile
